			"notes": "## What's changed?\n* Rewrote all the database code.\n  - ⚠️ The new database schema is incompatible with that of [version 0.1.0](https://github.com/kr8gz/EggHunt/releases/tag/0.1.0). Please delete any existing `EggHunt.db` file before using this version.\n  - This mod no longer depends on [JetBrain's Exposed framework](https://github.com/JetBrains/Exposed), which should fix some incompatibilities with other mods depending on a different version of it.\n  - Leaderboards are now generated entirely using SQL queries (and are sorted correctly).\n* Fixed an issue with egg block break detection."
		},
